Here's what was built for you:

**📁 File:** `ExpenseApproval/ExpenseApproval/ExpenseApproval.flow`

**What the flow does, step by step:**

```mermaid
graph LR
    trigger(Manual Trigger) -->|output| preparePacket[Prepare Review Packet]
    preparePacket -->|success| managerReview[Manager Review]
    managerReview -->|completed| checkDecision{Approved?}
    checkDecision -->|true| logApproved[Log Approval]
    checkDecision -->|false| logRejected[Log Rejection]
    logApproved -->|success| doneApproved(Done - Approved)
    logRejected -->|success| doneRejected(Done - Rejected)
```

1. **Manual Trigger** — starts when invoked with 4 inputs: `expenseId`, `submittedBy`, `amount`, `description`
2. **Prepare Review Packet** (Script) — bundles the inputs into a clean object with a human-readable summary line
3. **Manager Review** (HITL Quick Form) — pauses the flow and presents the manager with a read-only view of all expense details plus a free-text **Manager Comments** field; two action buttons: **Approve** and **Reject**
4. **Approved?** (Decision) — branches on the manager's choice (`status === "Approve"`)
5. **Log Approval / Log Rejection** (Scripts) — builds a structured log entry recording the decision, expense details, and manager comments
6. **Done - Approved / Done - Rejected** (End nodes) — returns three outputs: `approvalDecision` ("Approved"/"Rejected"), `approvalLog` (full log string), `managerComments`

**Validation:** ✅ Valid, no warnings
**Format:** ✅ Run, all nodes positioned

